## Why EDF needed to modernise

EDF’s national estate spans **millions of domestic and commercial meters**, generation telemetry and trading systems.

- **Fragmented data** — A dozen heterogeneous systems fed a legacy on-premise estate with no consistent Bronze / Silver / Gold discipline. Analysts hand-assembled Ofgem datasets from extracts.
- **Stale commercial insight** — Teams routinely worked with data **24–48 hours old**.
- **Reconciliation failures** — Roughly **6–8% of daily meter reads failed downstream validation each month**. Failures surfaced after billing, causing corrections and customer complaints.
- **Delayed operational response** — Batch-only meter, grid and generation telemetry exposed anomalies in the next morning’s report, after settlement or safety issues could propagate.

**Business case:** Reduce regulatory risk and reconciliation errors; give operations a current view while preserving deterministic, auditable batch reporting.

